{
  "id": "68f83c36fddc0a898f5322cf",
  "title": "サラダは食感を楽しむもの",
  "created": 1761098821,
  "updated": 1788274713,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "68f83c36fddc0a898f5322cf",
      "text": "サラダは食感を楽しむもの",
      "userId": "65b91ba0863c690027c9ec6a",
      "created": 1761098821,
      "updated": 1761098821
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83c440000000000a8aa3c",
      "text": " [海藻サラダ]の食感がいいかも、と聞いて、人によって[好みの食感]がありそうと思った[cak.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1761098821,
      "updated": 1788272003
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83c650000000000a8aa3e",
      "text": "  自分の好みはシャキシャキ系で、大根の千切り、キャベツの千切り、にんじんの千切りなどの[千切り]系が好き",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1761098854,
      "updated": 1788271618
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83c470000000000a8aa3d",
      "text": "　[はるひ.icon][きゅうり]。水分系っていうかかき氷系",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1761098824,
      "updated": 1788271630
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83cbc0000000000f75181",
      "text": "　　なぜ前置き記法した？",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1761098941,
      "updated": 1761098945
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83c8d0000000000f75180",
      "text": "  きゅうりもすき[cak.icon]",
      "userId": "65b91ba0863c690027c9ec6a",
      "created": 1761098893,
      "updated": 1761098920
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83cea0000000000f75182",
      "text": "  焼肉とかで[大根サラダ]頼みがちかも[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1761098987,
      "updated": 1788271635
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96e7b10000000000f00e37",
      "text": " 生野菜は味が多いものが多いから、素材の味よりも[ドレッシング]の味を強く感じる[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788274609,
      "updated": 1788274713
    },
    {
      "id": "68f83ca00000000000a8aa3f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65b91ba0863c690027c9ec6a",
      "created": 1761098913,
      "updated": 1761098913
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96dd750000000000f926ec",
      "text": "[サラダ]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1788271986,
      "updated": 1788271990
    },
    {
      "id": "6a96dd790000000000f926ed",
      "text": "[食感]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1788271990,
      "updated": 1788272014
    },
